---
/* GateNote — the members gate, kept warm: a dashed boundary, a lock in the
   accent, one short paragraph of why, room for a single CTA. An invitation
   rather than an error — it pairs with CtaPanel's voice, not Notice-danger's.
   Ported FROM blrhikes-app (2026-08-10). */
---

<div class="gate-note">
  <i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  <p class="gate-copy"><slot /></p>
  {Astro.slots.has("cta") && <p class="gate-cta"><slot name="cta" /></p>}
</div>
